{"id": "EUVD-2026-102271", "enisaUuid": "c86b1052-5b8e-372a-9c7e-202471367fb3", "description": "libansilove 1.3.0 through 1.4.2 contains a NULL pointer dereference vulnerability in ansilove_xbin() that allows attackers to crash applications by supplying a crafted XBIN file. Attackers can set the 512-character flag without the custom-font flag, causing drawchar() to index a NULL high_font_data_xbin pointer and terminate the process.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T18:57:35", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/libansilove-xbin-rle-oob-read-and-null-font-deref", "https://github.com/ansilove/libansilove/blob/f1b05447aa566aa4eef9b05ebf8c2aaf1e379cd3/src/loaders/xbin.c#L119-L166", "https://github.com/ansilove/libansilove/blob/f1b05447aa566aa4eef9b05ebf8c2aaf1e379cd3/src/loaders/xbin.c#L224-L232", "https://github.com/ansilove/libansilove/blob/f1b05447aa566aa4eef9b05ebf8c2aaf1e379cd3/src/drawchar.c#L28-L35", "https://github.com/ansilove/libansilove", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libansilove-1.3.0-through-1.4.2-null-pointer-dereference-via-ansilove-xbin"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111144", "GHSA-5h8x-q9qp-crv3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c41fa245-7592-3618-8b78-d86c67067dfe", "product": {"name": "libansilove", "vendor": {"name": "ansilove"}}, "product_version": "1.3.0 \u22641.4.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "dbd12122-f403-3e1f-ae7d-f377302c2677", "vendor": {"name": "ansilove"}}], "isExploited": false}